  "system": {
    "subType": "classFeat",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Engineer 12, Death Ray engineer trick</p><p>When the engineer fires his death ray, he can spend 3 of its daily uses to produce a disintegration beam, inflicting untyped damage. Any creature brought below 0 hit points by the beam is reduced to fine dust, as per the disintegrate spell. Additionally, the engineer can use the beam to disintegrate inanimate matter as per the disintegrate spell.</p>",
